I let my indignation get in the way of the really important bit:

I don't care if you teach Lojban by making students stand on their
head and recite the rock lyrics; all teaching of Lojban is good, and
Hurray! for the people doing it!

There's several people in #lojban IRC who have been making lessons,
and it's great to see that kind of activity.  Take a bow.
(publically, if you like, by replying to this)

-Robin

